WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Guile begins raw Drive Rush toward standing Manon.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.300
Standing medium punch connects from Rush.

3
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.000
Crouching heavy punch follows the medium.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.200
OD Sonic Boom lifts Manon beside the wall.

5
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:03.850
Heavy Flash Kick catches the projectile juggle.

6
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.400
Guile cancels the kick into the low-health Crossfire Somersault.

7
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.250
The Critical Art cinematic continues.

8
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:08.500
The Critical Art leaves Manon knocked down near the wall.
